  <div class="tile about-panel reveal">
    <p class="about-text">Most AI demos are a prompt box. Under a prompt box sits a lot of engineering: which model, how text becomes embeddings, what gets retrieved, when the model should call a tool, and how you'd know any of it is actually good. I care about all of those, and about the fundamentals under them: fast code, clear APIs, honest measurement. That's why I build in Rust and Go and measure my ideas against a baseline, and write up the experiments that failed.</p>
